1
00:00:00,646 --> 00:00:02,196
RentalPro — Administrator & Tenant Walkthrough — Signing in as the administrator, Abdur-Rahmaan Ali (admin@rentalpro.com)

2
00:00:02,734 --> 00:00:08,336
Administrator Dashboard — The whole Harare portfolio at a glance: 16 units, occupancy, rent collected, outstanding balances and open maintenance

3
00:00:08,356 --> 00:00:13,557
Administrator Menu — Alongside the management pages, the administrator alone has Manage Users; Add Staff creates maintenance staff accounts

4
00:00:13,682 --> 00:00:19,284
Manage Users & Roles — Every account in the system with its role and status — only the administrator can open this page

5
00:00:20,907 --> 00:00:25,107
Add a Staff Account — The administrator creates an account for a new maintenance technician, Tatenda Dube

6
00:00:25,898 --> 00:00:31,900
Account Created — Tatenda Dube now appears as Maintenance Staff — a welcome email with a link to set a password goes to the new account

7
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:35,762
Deactivating an Account — Untick Active and save — a deactivated account can no longer sign in

8
00:00:36,273 --> 00:00:41,474
Account Deactivated — Every role or status change is recorded in the audit log, and the user is emailed about it

9
00:00:41,816 --> 00:00:46,018
A Built-in Safeguard — Trying to change Tendai Moyo, the only Property Owner, into a Property Manager…

10
00:00:46,186 --> 00:00:51,787
Change Blocked — The system refuses: every account must keep at least one active Property Owner

11
00:00:52,407 --> 00:00:56,207
Full Management Access — The administrator can also open every management page — properties…

12
00:00:56,896 --> 00:01:00,496
Full Management Access — …tenants, with their units and balances…

13
00:01:01,211 --> 00:01:05,413
Full Management Access — …and portfolio reports, exportable to Excel and PDF

14
00:01:06,579 --> 00:01:08,052
Tenant Portal — Signing in as tenant Chipo Mutasa (tenant1@email.com) — tenants land on their own portal

15
00:01:08,457 --> 00:01:14,858
My Dashboard — Her unit at Avondale Heights, monthly rent of USD 850.00, the balance due, recent payments and her maintenance requests

16
00:01:14,875 --> 00:01:19,276
The Tenant Menu — Four items only: My Dashboard, Pay Rent, Payment History and Submit Request

17
00:01:19,929 --> 00:01:25,331
Full Account Statement — Rent due, payments, charges and the balance on her lease — downloadable as a PDF

18
00:01:25,948 --> 00:01:30,949
Payment History — Each payment with its method and receipt number — the history can be exported to CSV

19
00:01:31,303 --> 00:01:36,903
Payment Receipt — The Receipt button opens a PDF receipt for that payment

20
00:01:40,027 --> 00:01:44,627
Submit a Maintenance Request — Title, category, severity and a description — up to three photos can be attached

21
00:01:44,839 --> 00:01:51,241
Request Received — She gets a ticket number straight away, and the request appears under My Maintenance Requests; the owner is notified by email

22
00:01:51,881 --> 00:01:56,481
Pay Rent — The amount due for her unit — Pay Now goes to online checkout

23
00:01:56,755 --> 00:02:03,157
Payment Successful — Offline, a simulated checkout stands in for Stripe: the payment is recorded and her balance is now zero

24
00:02:03,743 --> 00:02:08,543
Payment History — The online payment is listed with its own receipt number

25
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:14,751
Only Her Own Data — Management pages are refused to tenants — she can see only her own lease, payments and requests

26
00:02:15,371 --> 00:02:19,972
RentalPro — IT401 Capstone — Administrator and tenant walkthrough. Thank you.

